  "[action] Wang Lung is puzzled by his son's pride.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung expresses his confusion about his son's pride.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and why do you do all this?\"",
  "[action] The second son stands proudly beside his brother.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and because I am the eldest and we have not been very well treated by the father and it is not right that we should live in a little house and the sons of rich men should have a great house.\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son stands proudly by his brother.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and why not, then?\"",
